=== mem-leak harness: phase 1, first use, warm-up and comparison per shape ===

=== mls-1: control: numeric twin of mls-5, MIN/MAX(DECIMAL) per customer, 20000 groups sent ===
idle level before the first execution: QUERY_MEMORY and TRANSACTION_MEMORY recorded on all 4 data nodes
reference run: 1 execution(s) via RDRS, every result identical to the reference
warm-up: 8 execution(s) via RDRS, 8 concurrent clients, every 200 response identical to the reference
first use: QUERY_MEMORY and TRANSACTION_MEMORY within the first-use allowance on all 4 data nodes
== Query ==
SELECT o.lg_cust, MIN(c.lc_balance), MAX(c.lc_balance), COUNT(*)
FROM lg_orders AS o JOIN lg_cust AS c ON c.lc_id = o.lg_cust
GROUP BY o.lg_cust;

Number of output lines, including header: 20001

